    "title": "Samaritan Health dropping Medicare Advantage plans at end of year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Quinton Smith, Lincoln Chronicle ,\n1 hours ago Samaritan Health Plans has notified thousands of its Medicare customers in Benton, Lincoln and Linn counties that it will end its popular Advantage insurance plans at the end of the year. In a letter received by its Advantage clients over the Labor Day weekend, Samaritan did not divulge its reasons... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
